## Data quality

- Sampled for 60 seconds, every 2 seconds, with no gaps (31 samples).
- Kernel 6.8, cgroup v2, pressure files and memory.peak.
- Could not read the kernel log at /dev/kmsg: no log, so kill times are unknown.
- Provider and region came from the cloud metadata service at 169.254.169.254. Skip it with --offline.

The memory model behind these numbers is published at https://snugbox.dev/docs/memory-model.
